  "flow_summary": "The interviewer successfully navigated a challenging, disorganized patient persona by consistently re-explaining questions and maintaining a structured, patient approach. While the interviewer was effective at guiding the patient, the process became somewhat mechanical during the questionnaire phase, where the system repeatedly forced the patient to choose from the scale despite the patient's clear difficulty in doing so.",
